{"text":"kuruntokai","n":45,"lines":["காலை யெழுந்து கடுந்தேர் பண்ணி","வாலிழை மகளிர்த் தழீஇய சென்ற","மல்ல லூரன் எல்லினன் பெரிதென","மறுவருஞ் சிறுவன் தாயே","தெறுவ தம்மவித் திணைப்பிறத் தல்லே"],"tr":["kālai yeḻuntu kaṭuntēr paṇṇi","vāliḻai makaḷirt taḻīiya ceṉṟa","malla lūraṉ elliṉaṉ periteṉa","maṟuvaruñ ciṟuvaṉ tāyē","teṟuva tammavit tiṇaippiṟat tallē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"marutam","tinai_ta":"மருதம்","speaker_ta":"தோழி கூற்று","poet_ta":"ஆலங்குடி வங்கனார்","speaker_en":"her friend (tōḻi)","poet_tr":"Ālaṅkuṭi Vaṅkaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 19"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 12, veṇṭaḷai 6"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"காலை","tr":"kālai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"யெழுந்து","tr":"yeḻuntu","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யெழுந்","tr":"yeḻun"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]},{"text":"கடுந்தேர்","tr":"kaṭuntēr","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கடுந்","tr":"kaṭun"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தேர்","tr":"tēr"}]},{"text":"பண்ணி","tr":"paṇṇi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பண்","tr":"paṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணி","tr":"ṇi"}]}],[{"text":"வாலிழை","tr":"vāliḻai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லிழை","tr":"liḻai"}]},{"text":"மகளிர்த்","tr":"makaḷirt","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மக","tr":"maka"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளிர்த்","tr":"ḷirt"}]},{"text":"தழீஇய","tr":"taḻīiya","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தழீ","tr":"taḻī"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"இய","tr":"iya"}]},{"text":"சென்ற","tr":"ceṉṟa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சென்","tr":"ceṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ற","tr":"ṟa"}]}],[{"text":"மல்ல","tr":"malla","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மல்","tr":"mal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ல","tr":"la"}]},{"text":"லூரன்","tr":"lūraṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லூ","tr":"lū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரன்","tr":"raṉ"}]},{"text":"எல்லினன்","tr":"elliṉaṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"எல்","tr":"el"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லினன்","tr":"liṉaṉ"}]},{"text":"பெரிதென","tr":"periteṉa","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெரி","tr":"peri"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தென","tr":"teṉa"}]}],[{"text":"மறுவருஞ்","tr":"maṟuvaruñ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மறு","tr":"maṟu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வருஞ்","tr":"varuñ"}]},{"text":"சிறுவன்","tr":"ciṟuvaṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிறு","tr":"ciṟu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வன்","tr":"vaṉ"}]},{"text":"தாயே","tr":"tāyē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தா","tr":"tā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யே","tr":"yē"}]}],[{"text":"தெறுவ","tr":"teṟuva","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தெறு","tr":"teṟu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வ","tr":"va"}]},{"text":"தம்மவித்","tr":"tammavit","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தம்","tr":"tam"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மவித்","tr":"mavit"}]},{"text":"திணைப்பிறத்","tr":"tiṇaippiṟat","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"திணைப்","tr":"tiṇaip"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பிறத்","tr":"piṟat"}]},{"text":"தல்லே","tr":"tallē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தல்","tr":"tal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லே","tr":"lē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"காலை","parts":[{"text":"காலை","lemma":"காலை","gloss":"morning"}],"gloss":"morning"},{"surface":"எழுந்து","parts":[{"text":"எழுந்து","lemma":"எழு","gloss":"having risen"}],"gloss":"having risen"},{"surface":"கடும்","parts":[{"text":"கடும்","lemma":"கடுமை","gloss":"swift"}],"gloss":"swift"},{"surface":"தேர்","parts":[{"text":"தேர்","lemma":"தேர்","gloss":"chariot"}],"gloss":"chariot"},{"surface":"பண்ணி","parts":[{"text":"பண்ணி","lemma":"பண்ணு","gloss":"having prepared"}],"gloss":"having prepared"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வால்","parts":[{"text":"வால்","lemma":"வால்","gloss":"bright"}],"gloss":"bright"},{"surface":"இழை","parts":[{"text":"இழை","lemma":"இழை","gloss":"ornaments"}],"gloss":"ornaments"},{"surface":"மகளிர்","parts":[{"text":"மகளிர்","lemma":"மகளிர்","gloss":"women"}],"gloss":"women"},{"surface":"தழீஇய","parts":[{"text":"தழீஇய","lemma":"தழுவு","gloss":"having embraced"}],"gloss":"having embraced"},{"surface":"சென்ற","parts":[{"text":"சென்ற","lemma":"செல்","gloss":"who went"}],"gloss":"who went"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மல்லல்","parts":[{"text":"மல்லல்","lemma":"மல்லல்","gloss":"fertile"}],"gloss":"fertile"},{"surface":"ஊரன்","parts":[{"text":"ஊரன்","lemma":"ஊரன்","gloss":"lord of the town"}],"gloss":"lord of the town"},{"surface":"எல்லினன்","parts":[{"text":"எல்லினன்","lemma":"எல்","gloss":"he who delayed until night"}],"gloss":"he who delayed until night"},{"surface":"பெரிது","parts":[{"text":"பெரிது","lemma":"பெரிது","gloss":"greatly"}],"gloss":"greatly"},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"என","gloss":"saying"}],"gloss":"saying"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மறுவரும்","parts":[{"text":"மறுவரும்","lemma":"மறுவருதல்","gloss":"bewildered"}],"gloss":"bewildered"},{"surface":"சிறுவன்","parts":[{"text":"சிறுவன்","lemma":"சிறுவன்","gloss":"little boy"}],"gloss":"little boy"},{"surface":"தாயே","parts":[{"text":"தாய்","lemma":"தாய்","gloss":"mother"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"mother indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தெறுவது","parts":[{"text":"தெறுவது","lemma":"தெறுதல்","gloss":"tormenting thing"}],"gloss":"tormenting thing"},{"surface":"அம்ம","parts":[{"text":"அம்ம","lemma":"அம்ம","gloss":"alas"}],"gloss":"alas"},{"surface":"இத்","parts":[{"text":"இத்","lemma":"இ","gloss":"this"}],"gloss":"this"},{"surface":"திணை","parts":[{"text":"திணை","lemma":"திணை","gloss":"status"}],"gloss":"status"},{"surface":"பிறத்தல்","parts":[{"text":"பிறத்தல்","lemma":"பிறத்தல்","gloss":"being born"}],"gloss":"being born"},{"surface":"ஏ","parts":[{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed"}]}],"literal":"In the morning having risen, a swift chariot having prepared, / bright-ornamented women to embrace, who went / the lord of the fertile town, he delayed until night greatly, saying, / the bewildered little boy's mother, / is tormented, alas, in this status being born indeed.","translation":"Rising early in the morning, he readied his swift chariot and went to embrace women wearing bright ornaments. Because the lord of this fertile town has delayed so long into the night, the mother of his bewildered little boy is in deep torment. Alas, how painful it is to be born into this status of a wife!","modern":"காலையில் எழுந்து வேகமான தேரை ஆயத்தம் செய்து, பிரகாசமான ஆபரணங்களை அணிந்த பரத்தையரைத் தழுவச் சென்ற வளமான ஊரின் தலைவன், இரவு வரை மிகவும் தாமதித்துவிட்டான் என்று எண்ணி, கலங்கும் தன் சிறு மகனின் தாயான தலைவி வருந்துகிறாள். ஐயோ, இந்த இல்லறத் தலைவி என்ற நிலையில் பிறப்பது மிகவும் துன்பம் தருவதாகும்.","explanation":"This poem is set in the Marutam (agricultural) landscape, where the theme is infidelity and the wife's sulking. The speaker is the heroine's friend (தோழி), who is expressing her deep sympathy and frustration on behalf of the heroine. The hero has left early in the morning in his swift chariot to visit courtesans, and has delayed his return until late at night. The heroine, who is the mother of his young, innocent son, waits in anguish and bewilderment. The friend laments the painful fate of women born into the status of a wife, who must endure such neglect and betrayal. The key words are 'எல்லினன்' (he delayed until night) and 'தெறுவது' (it is tormenting), highlighting the emotional pain caused by the hero's unfaithfulness.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}